  "title": "National CineMedia Names Bernadette McCabe Vice President, Exhibitor Relations",
  "summary": "National CineMedia (NASDAQ:NCMI) (“NCM”), the largest cinema advertising platform in the US, today announced Bernadette McCabe as Vice President, Exhibitor Relations for NCM and Spotlight, effective May 5, 2026. McCabe will succeed Jennifer Lupo, who will retire from the Company on May 4, 2026. McCabe and Lupo will continue to work closely to ensure a seamless transition for the Company’s partners.",
